@startuml

title 发帖（含多图上传）
actor User
participant MiniProgram as MP
participant Backend as API
participant Storage as SupabaseStorage
participant DB as SupabaseDB

User -> MP: 选择图片/输入内容
MP -> API: POST /uploads/presign (N 个文件)
API -> Storage: 生成上传凭证/路径
Storage --> API: 上传信息（bucket/path）
API --> MP: 返回 uploadUrls / objectPaths
MP -> Storage: 直接上传文件到 Storage
MP -> API: POST /posts (content, mediaPaths, visibility)
API -> DB: INSERT posts / post_media
DB --> API: 新帖子 id
API --> MP: 返回帖子详情

newpage
title 下单（从购物车/详情页）
User -> MP: 进入结算页
MP -> API: POST /shop/order/preview
API -> DB: 查询 sku/库存/优惠
DB --> API: 预览金额
API --> MP: 返回预览
User -> MP: 提交订单
MP -> API: POST /shop/order
API -> DB: INSERT orders/order_items; 预占库存
DB --> API: order_no
API --> MP: 返回订单信息
User -> MP: 发起支付
MP -> API: POST /shop/pay
API -> DB: INSERT payments
API --> MP: 返回支付参数

newpage
title 私信发送消息
User -> MP: 输入文本并发送
MP -> API: POST /im/messages
API -> DB: INSERT dm_messages; 更新 dm_conversations.last_message
DB --> API: message_id
API --> MP: 返回消息
API -> MP: (Realtime) 推送给对方新消息事件

@enduml

